ter;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .img-boat {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 48px;\n    right: 8px;\n    width: 190px;\n    height: 110px;\n  }\n  .img-mountain {\n    width: 240px;\n    height: 120px;\n    margin: 10px auto 0 auto;\n  }\n  .sec2 {\n    position: relative;\n    margin-top: 24px;\n  }\n  .sec2 h2.section {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 42px;\n    left: 6px;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sec2-body {\n    padding-top: 12px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\"><span class=\"u\">桂林景点指南</span></h1>\n\n  <div style=\"position:relative;\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder img-boat\">[插图：象鼻山竹筏游船，右上角]</div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"section\">象鼻山</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"tag\">门票</span>：免费</div>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"tag\">交通</span>：</div>\n    <p class=\"line\">16路公交车在象山公园站下车；100路公交车阳桥站下车后步行700米</p>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"tag\">游玩小指南：</span></div>\n    <p class=\"item\">1、推荐从1号门进园，3号门出园，可以完整的浏览象山不走回头路</p>\n    <p class=\"item\">2、不要坐这里的竹筏，电动竹筏行程距离短，而且市区风景并不算好</p>\n    <p class=\"item\">3、爬象山要绕到水月洞那边才有路上山， 里面的竹筏不推荐乘坐，性价比不高</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sec2\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder img-mountain\">[插图：山峰与日出，居中]</div>\n    <h2 class=\"section\">芦笛岩</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"sec2-body\">\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"tag\">门票</span>：90</div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"tag\">交通</span>：</div>\n      <p class=\"line\">3路公交车大约40分钟抵达芦笛岩，打车20分钟</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"tag\">游玩小指南：</span></div>\n      <p class=\"item\">1、网络票强制要求1小时后才能使用，不要到了门口才去网上买票</p>\n      <p class=\"item\">2、溶洞最佳拍照点有两个，一个在水帘洞，另一个是水帘洞后面的倒影池水旁</p>\n      <p class=\"item\">3、不要坐小火车，走路很快就能到洞口了</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
